1
00:00:20,078 --> 00:00:28,852
We walk along the autumn field,
Our bleeding hearts are never healed.

2
00:00:29,052 --> 00:00:36,418
We sit upon the weathered wood,
I want to ask you if I could.

3
00:00:36,618 --> 00:00:45,187
But it did not happen today,
The hardest words I could not say.

4
00:00:45,764 --> 00:00:54,137
My Lion did not dare to roar,
He closed his eyes and said no more.

5
00:00:56,189 --> 00:01:03,623
I pull you close into my side,
With nothing left for us to hide.

6
00:01:04,934 --> 00:01:12,325
I want to break this heavy chain,
And steal us from this endless pain.

7
00:01:12,512 --> 00:01:20,484
But it did not happen today,
The hardest words I could not say.

8
00:01:21,987 --> 00:01:30,241
My Lion did not dare to roar,
He closed his eyes and said no more.

9
00:01:31,815 --> 00:01:40,017
I hold your hand, 'Please marry me,
And build our life to set us free.'

10
00:01:40,740 --> 00:01:48,243
You cry and whisper: 'Yes, I will,'
And for a moment, time is still.

11
00:01:48,438 --> 00:01:57,118
But it did not happen today,
The hardest words I could not say.

12
00:01:57,663 --> 00:02:06,437
My Lion did not dare to roar,
He closed his eyes and said no more.

13
00:02:07,725 --> 00:02:15,680
The fields grow dark, the sun goes down,
We walk back to the heavy town.

14
00:02:16,898 --> 00:02:24,187
The question hangs, we do not speak,
The Lion sleeps, so cold and weak.

15
00:02:24,378 --> 00:02:32,811
But it did not happen today,
The hardest words I could not say.

16
00:02:33,633 --> 00:02:42,672
My Lion did not dare to roar,
He closed his eyes and said no more.

17
00:02:43,658 --> 00:02:52,330
The sun is gone, the shadows deep,
The silent Lion falls asleep.

18
00:02:52,648 --> 00:02:59,698
No words were spoken in the cold,
The saddest story ever told.

19
00:02:59,866 --> 00:03:08,299
Because it did not happen that day,
The hardest words I could not say.

20
00:03:09,619 --> 00:03:18,701
My Lion did not dare to roar,
He closed his eyes and said no more.

